194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Fibiyo E-Commerce Platform is a full-stack application architected with Angular for the frontend, Spring Boot for the backend, and MySQL as the relational database. The backend implements a RESTful API adhering to a layered architecture \(Application, Domain, Infrastructure\) and utilizes Spring Security with JWT for authentication and role-based authorization \(Customer, Seller, Admin\). Core functionalities include user registration and profile management, product cataloging with category hierarchy, AI-assisted image generation \(OpenAI DALL-E/ChatGPT integration\), "Feels" short video management, shopping cart operations, a secure checkout process leveraging Stripe for payment processing, and comprehensive order management. The system features distinct capabilities for Admins \(user/product/order/coupon/review/feel management\), Sellers \(product/order/feel management, AI image tools, subscription benefits\), and Customers \(browsing, reviews, cart, orders, wishlist\). The frontend is built with standalone components, signals for state management, and lazy-loaded feature modules, interacting with the backend via well-defined API endpoints. Data persistence is managed by Spring Data JPA, and MapStruct is utilized for DTO-entity mapping. The overall design prioritizes scalability, maintainability, and a modular approach to development.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
