588 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Fibiyo E-Commerce Platform stands as a testament to our dedication in crafting a secure, scalable, and deeply user-centric digital marketplace. By integrating cutting-edge technologies like Angular for a responsive frontend, Spring Boot for a robust backend, and MySQL for persistent data storage, we have engineered a rich e-commerce ecosystem. This system not only supports essential functionalities such as comprehensive user and product management, an intuitive shopping cart, and secure Stripe-powered checkout, but also introduces innovative features tailored to distinct Customer, Seller, and Admin roles.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
589 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Key differentiators include the "Feels" feature, empowering sellers with dynamic short-video product showcases to significantly enhance engagement, and AI-driven tools like seller-assisted image generation. Our architectural choices, emphasizing a layered design and RESTful API principles, ensure maintainability and future growth. Looking ahead, we are excited to further leverage AI capabilities by integrating features such as automated review summarization and optimization, aiming to continuously refine the user experience and provide deeper insights. This project successfully meets contemporary e-commerce demands while establishing a strong foundation for ongoing innovation and the incorporation of advanced, value-driven functionalities.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
